{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_handoff", "label": "Session 85 Combined Handoff", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_semi85", "label": "semi85.py (The Bound Instrument)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_k_bound", "label": "The K Bound (K := 2 V+ / (L^2 a) < 1  =>  J < 2  =>  G-within)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Derived and verified with zero violations over 185 real channels - and too weak: it certifies l = 0 only, informative at 24 of 74 frontier channels. K = 1 separates s from everything while J = 2 separates five channels from everything, and the two cuts are not the same cut."}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_tent_extremiser", "label": "The One-Kink Tent Extremiser (J_tent = 2 Exactly)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "J is convex in delta and delta affine in S, so the maximiser over the admissible set is a one-kink tent whose pieces leave the radicand quadratic - and it saturates at exactly 2 on b0+b1 = 1, every split."}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_z56_new_site", "label": "Z=56 (Barium) Is the New Site", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The largest J in the set is Barium's, not Thorium's, and Z=56 is the one genuine disagreement when s84's sign rule is re-scored - dg/dl(5d) = -0.441 against banked +0.363. Zr and Ba are not actinide openings and their rows are clean at width 2, so dg/dl < 0 at a frontier channel does not imply the row fails."}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_f85_1", "label": "F85.1 A Bitwise Operator Inside the Can-Fail Gate Itself", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'ok &= g' with a truthy non-boolean clause result: True & 2 = 0 printed FAIL while every clause printed PASS, and with int 3 it would have printed PASS over a failing clause."}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_f85_2", "label": "F85.2 A False Falsification of the Previous Session", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "s84's S7 was re-scored with a SECOND difference where the clause is a FIRST difference, reading 17/37 disagreements - an apparent collapse of the previous session's headline, caught only by re-reading its table. Correctly scored it is 35/37."}, {"id": "recovered_session_85_combined_gauss_next_step", "label": "Next: Q Monotone and 1 <= Q <= Z Must Raise the Threshold", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The saturating tent uses only endpoint slopes and violates two constraints the real q obeys, so re-taking the extreme point over the admissible set intersected with Gauss's constraints should move K = 1 upward. The p channels sit at K ~ 1.10 with J ~ 1.61 - a long way inside."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_handoff", "target": "recovered_session_84_combined_handoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_handoff", "target": "recovered_session_85_combined_semi85", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_semi85", "target": "recovered_session_84_combined_semi84", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_semi85", "target": "recovered_session_85_combined_k_bound", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_tent_extremiser", "target": "recovered_session_85_combined_k_bound", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_k_bound", "target": "recovered_session_84_combined_dg_dl_criterion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_z56_new_site", "target": "recovered_session_84_combined_dg_dl_criterion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-85-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_session_85_combined_f85_2", "target": "recovered_session_84_combined_semi84", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "con